\v 8 It'll be like a hungry¦291906 \add >person\add* dreaming and eating¦291908 \add in the dream\add*, then waking up with an empty¦291910 \add ≈stomach\add*.
\q1 ≈Or like a thirsty¦291914 \add >person\add* dreaming and drinking¦291916 \add in the dream\add*, then waking up with a dry throat¦291920 and feeling faint¦291919.
\q1 That's what it'll be like for all those nations¦291927 which go¦291928 to war against Mt¦291931. Tsiyyon¦291932 (Zion¦291932).
