\v 11 Then¦291967 to you all, the entire vision¦291969 will be like the words¦291971 sealed in a scroll¦291972—
\q1 if it's handed to \add ≈a person who's educated\add* to read out, they'll say¦291983, ‘I¦291990 can't¦291989, because¦291991 it is sealed up.’
\q1
\v 12 ^\add ≈Or if\add* the scroll¦291996 is given¦291995 to \add ≈an uneducated person\add* to read out, they'll say¦292003, ‘I¦292010 can't¦291999 read.’
\p
\v 13 My master¦292015 says,
\q1 “\add ≈Yes,\add* \add #those people\add* come close to me with \add ≈what their mouths¦292021 say\add*,
\q1 ≈and honour¦292023 me with \add ≈lipservice\add*,
